OL,3,ASeven killed and 23 missing in boat
OL,4,Acapsizing off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least seven people have died and 23
OL,7,Fothers are still missing after a
OL,8,Fpassenger boat capsized off northern
OL,9,FCyprus, the head of the Turkish
OL,10,Fadministration there has said.
OL,12,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,13,Fself-proclaimed Turkish republic there,
OL,14,Fsaid the ferry had been carrying 259
OL,15,Fpassengers and eight crew members when
OL,16,Fit began taking on water after
OL,17,Fdeparting the coastal town of Kyrenia.
OL,19,FThe ship's captain and seven crew
OL,20,Fmembers have been detained as part of
OL,21,Fan investigation into "how this tragedy
OL,22,Foccurred", Ustel wrote on social media.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
