OL,3,ASeven killed and 23 missing in boat
OL,4,Acapsizing off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search and rescue operation to find
OL,7,Fthe passengers still unaccounted for is
OL,8,Funder way, which Turkish authorities
OL,9,Fhave joined. Turkish media is reporting
OL,10,Fthe death toll has risen to eight.
